[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0010","text":"『从头到尾完全没有中断，最棒的歌声一直流淌着\n　听的人也要以零妥协的标准准备好』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0020","text":"啊～想加个描边什么的但空间不够……！\n想要张大概十倍大的纸……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0029","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0030","text":"又在写一辈子宣传卡了\n该走了吧，日花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0040","text":"诶──\n哇糟了都这个点了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0050","text":"不好意思我先走了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0059","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0060","text":"哦，辛苦了\n那边我帮你收拾，快去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0070","text":"真的帮大忙了……！\n辛苦了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0080","text":"辛苦了——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0085","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0090","text":"啊…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0095","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0100","text":"──辛苦了\n录制结束了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0110","text":"『啊啊，谢谢联系我\n　还要打工，很辛苦吧』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0120","text":"完全没问题啦\n只是坐着而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0130","text":"只要人在就能算工作，真是太好了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0140","text":"『…………我不觉得你能那么轻松应付』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0150","text":"──那能不能别把多余的事推给我啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0160","text":"『啊，啊啊，那倒是抱歉。不过……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0170","text":"正如您所说我累了，先告辞了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03240000_02_0180","text":"…………\n特别训练什么的，完全搞不懂"}]
